{"id":"wb-7-1382","name":"沘江古桥梁群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"沘江古桥梁群","text":"沘（bǐ）江古桥梁群位于云南省大理州云龙县境内的沘江及其支流上，包含37座不同类型的古桥梁，2013年3月公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n云龙县是云南省古桥梁保存最多且最完整的地区，大多集中在沘江及其支流之上，现存各类古桥40余座，多建于明清及民国初年，涵盖“梁、浮、拱、吊”四大基本类型，有“桥梁博物馆”、“世界古桥梁艺术博物馆”之称。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%98%E6%B1%9F%E5%8F%A4%E6%A1%A5%E6%A2%81%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":89474955,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89474955","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fbee26eebb242b36185e49c0.jpg","title":"云龙通京桥.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BA%91%E9%BE%99%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%AC%E6%A1%A5.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/%E4%BA%91%E9%BE%99%E9%80%9A%E4%BA%AC%E6%A1%A5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Rod Waddington","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","caption":"云龙通京桥","width":320,"height":205}}